      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think the reason for the instance page instead of the main world page is because the instance page can be viewed by anyone online where as the world page requires a VRChat login to view.\n\nIt would be nice if it did direct to the main world page but had a simplified view for viewers who aren't logged in.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
