  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-06-14T11:31:13.248Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "At the moment when you click this button on World Detail Page, it gives link to Instance Link page instead World Detail page.\n\nI personally prefer to redirected to World Detail page than Instance Link page as I add to favourite first and go to world added.\n\n(I meant....I hop batch than only that world usually so it is more convenient to linked to world detail page which has add to favourite button straight to there.)\n\n======\n\nSome way to implement as suggestion.\n\n1. Have choice of URL to use for share\n\nThis way, user can choose from instance URL or world details page URL.\n\nGood for existing user, but non-existing user cannot access URL\n\n2. Add World Detail Page but non-existing user can see overview\n\nThis is good for both party but may require major rework on Website workflow.",
